      "role": "Atmospheric background glow behind hero content",
      "description": "Radial gradient blooming from center-top, combining the nebula blue (#3245ff at 30% opacity) blending into the void canvas (#1f232e). The gradient is positioned above the text layer with mix-blend-mode for a soft cosmic glow effect. No hard edges."
